--- README claim (package/README.md) ---
84:The CLI checks the tree head it fetches for the receipt. An embedded key still has to match the trusted-kid pin, or the kid has to be in a verified issuer-history entry. The head's signed `anchors.base.from` and `anchors.solana.fee_payer` must be on the anchor-wallet list. The chain sender and fee payer must be those wallets. `--version` prints `chit402-verify 0.4.6`. Flags other than `--issuer-history` and `--json` exit 1.
